# Founders

Angular 22, Spring Boot (`com.founderslab`), Playwright. Not Electron. [docs/architecture/CURRENT_STATE.md](docs/architecture/CURRENT_STATE.md) is a historical empty-repo audit. Follow [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) and the live tree.

- Features call `LabApi` or `SessionApi`. Do not import `HttpClient` in `frontend/src/app/features/`.
- Poll a research job with `pollJob` from `core/research/poll-job.ts`. Do not copy `timer(0, 2000)` into a feature.
- A feature may import `findings/finding-review` only. Other features meet at the router and the API.
- Change [docs/api/API_CONTRACTS.md](docs/api/API_CONTRACTS.md) before a new field. Refresh types with `npm run generate:api` in `frontend/`. Do not hand-edit `schema.ts`.
- Controllers do not import `integration.sources` or `integration.ai`. Use `ResearchSourceAdapter`, not `CensusCountyBusinessPatternsAdapter`.
- Tests and Playwright use fixtures. Do not call live Census or a paid model.
- UI work is unfinished until `.cursor/skills/verify-founders` has driven that feature.
- `/poteto-mode` for non-trivial work. `/correct` turns a repeated mistake into a lint or test. `/reflect` updates a skill when the lesson is workflow.
